{
	"name": "New Horizons",
	"description": "Curated rules: three Orders, two battle-persistent Doctrines, and six magic schools with six ranked school skills. Existing hero spells are reclassified; the planned new spell roster is not yet implemented. Provisional coefficients, costs and flagged faction assignments. New games snapshot rules; legacy saves retain their original semantics. Generated by tools/update-new-horizons-module.py from canonical config/newHorizons*.json data. Separate future development candidate: provisional class primary profiles, scaled hero formulas and skill-related extra growth. Not the frozen commands/schools release or full mastery/tier implementation. Separate capability candidate: non-destructive soft leadership capacity and skill-trained ballista scaling. No mastery or creature-category implementation. Separate future Artillery mastery candidate: one permanent extra choice after a level gained with prior Expert Artillery. Not secondary rank four or completion of other mastery families, creature tiers or new spell effects. Includes independently authored quick-save/load buttons and creature ability icons; landscape presentation only.",
